{"id":"NCT05945524","title":"Analysis of the Resistance and Sensitivity Mechanisms to Teclistamab by Focusing on Single Immune Cell Examination","official":"Analysis of the Resistance and Sensitivity Mechanisms to Teclistamab by Focusing on Single Immune Cell Examination","summary":"The aim of this study is to discover the immune and oncogenomic features that distinguish patients who respond to teclistamab from patients who are primarily resistant. Moreover, phenotypic and genotypic characteristics that occur with secondary resistance to teclistamab will be analyzed.","conditions":["Multiple Myeloma"],"interventions":[{"type":"OTHER","name":"Bone marrow sampling"}],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* With multiple myeloma\n* Who receive Teclistamab\n* Consent form signed\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Patient under legal protection","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"INTERVENTIONAL","purpose":"OTHER","enrollment":100,"start":"2023-09-28","pcd":"2026-03-31","upd":"2025-04-10","sponsor":"University Hospital, Toulouse","areas":["oncology","rare"],"central":["Hervé AVET LOISEAU, MD, PhD · +33 531 156 142 ext. 33 · avetloiseau.herve@iuct-oncopole.fr"],"sites":[{"f":"CHU d'Amiens","city":"Amiens","pr":"","zip":"80054","s":"R","lat":49.9,"lon":2.3,"c":"Lydia MONTES, MD · 0222455482 ext. 33 · montes.lydia@chu-amiens.fr"},{"f":"CHU de Caen","city":"Caen","pr":"","zip":"14033","s":"R","lat":49.1859,"lon":-0.3591,"c":"Margaret MACRO, MD, PhD · 0231272633 ext. 33 · macro-m@chu-caen.fr"},{"f":"Polyclinique du Parc Drevon","city":"Dijon","pr":"","zip":"21000","s":"R","lat":47.3134,"lon":5.0139,"c":"Ingrid LAFON, MD · 0380294506 ext. 33 · ilafon@icb-cancer.fr"},{"f":"CH Annecy Genevois","city":"Epagny Metz- Tessy","pr":"","zip":"74370","s":"R","lat":null,"lon":null,"c":"Frédérique ORSINI PIOCELLE, MD · 0450636144 ext. 33 · forsinipiocelle@ch-annecygenevois.fr"},{"f":"CHU de Lille","city":"Lille","pr":"","zip":"59037","s":"R","lat":50.6339,"lon":